    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_00",
      "hash64": "D1EDE1F9BC47230F",
      "text": "哎呀，我說[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳……\\n看來[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在前世有過很多經歷？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_01",
      "hash64": "D1EDE0F9BC47215C",
      "text": "用手機來占卜前世的記憶……\\n我就叫它做手機占卜，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要試試看嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_02",
      "hash64": "D1EDE3F9BC472675",
      "text": "果然我還是聽起來很可疑，是吧……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_03",
      "hash64": "D1EDE2F9BC4724C2",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳前世的記憶……！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳當時生活的地方是……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_028_select_a",
      "hash64": "35D0BFAD69D0E96D",
      "text": "關都地區？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_028_select_b",
      "hash64": "35D0BCAD69D0E454",
      "text": "伽勒爾地區？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_028_select_c",
      "hash64": "35D0BDAD69D0E607",
      "text": "神奧地區？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_028_select_d",
      "hash64": "35D0BAAD69D0E0EE",
      "text": "洗翠地區？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_028_select_e",
      "hash64": "35D0BBAD69D0E2A1",
      "text": "不用了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_04",
      "hash64": "D1EDDDF9BC471C43",
      "text": "鏘鏘！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳前世時所在的地方是……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_a",
      "hash64": "036CE3FECEFF3FC2",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在關都地區\\r\\n和搭檔的寶可夢Let's Go！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_b",
      "hash64": "036CE2FECEFF3E0F",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在伽勒爾地區面對挑戰，\\r\\n還把寶可夢極巨化！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_c",
      "hash64": "036CE1FECEFF3C5C",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在神奧地區鑽到地底下，\\r\\n還參加超級華麗大賽！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
