    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_d",
      "hash64": "036CE0FECEFF3AA9",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在洗翠地區帶著\\r\\n神秘的手機展開大冒險！\\r\\n……洗翠地區在哪裡啊！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_05",
      "hash64": "D1EDDCF9BC471A90",
      "text": "……按照[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的記憶，\\n我來做一個手機殼給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
